<title>USA: NYSE pre-closing imbalances.</title>
<headline>NYSE pre-closing imbalances.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange reported the following quarterly pre-closing imbalances, including Lucent Technologies with a buy imbalance of 2,359,300 shares. The others were:</p>
<p>AFL SELL 72,000</p>
<p>HRC BUY 121,000</p>
<p>WMT BUY 152,400</p>
<p>OM SELL 276,400</p>
<p>KFS BUY 165,000</p>
<p>HWP BUY 59,700</p>
<p>CHV BUY 51,100  </p>
<p>SBC BUY 55,000</p>
<p>GE BUY 63,200</p>
<p>TDW BUY 90,800</p>
<p>BOW BUY 55,000</p>
<p>KO BUY 144,700</p>
<p>CAH BUY 83,300</p>
<p>CTL BUY 77,000</p>
<p>BSE BUY 86,000</p>
<p>SAI SELL 60,000</p>
<p>AMX BUY 51,800</p>
<p>EDS BUY 571,300</p>
<p>SUB BUY 50,900</p>
<p>IC BUY 96,000</p>
<p>AOL BUY 196,500 AND</p>
<p>FON BUY 63,300.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
